  "marks": {
    "1": "When a 14 bit value is sent, the lower 7bits are first sent via a CC #63(0x3f) message.",
    "3": "BANK A (Red LED) Program 1~7: pp 0~6 / BANK B (Blue LED) Program 1~7: pp 7~13",
    "4": "Transmitted when R  : Request message is received. E  : Exclusive message is received.",
    "7": "Non Registered Parameter Number (NRPN)",
    "8": "Registered Parameter Number (RPN)",
    "9": "This message is recognized when the \"Clock\" is set to \"Auto\".",
    "2-1": "VCO1 SCALE: 32',16',8',4',2 = vv: 0,31,63,95,127",
    "2-2": "VCO1 MODE: Triangle,Square,Saw,Chorus1,Chorus2 = vv: 0,31,63,95,127",
    "2-3": "VCO2 MODE: DUET,MODULATOR1,MODULATOR2,MODULATOR3,NOISE1,NOISE2 = vv: 0,25,50,76,101,127",
    "2-4": "Function switches: OFF, ON = vv:0,127",
    "5-1": "This message is recognized when the \"MIDI Rx Short Messages\" is set to \"On\".",
    "5-2": "When a 14 bit value is received, the lower 7 bits are first expected via a CC #63(0x3f) message. The lowest 4 bits of the 14 bit values will be internally ignored, resulting in a resolution of 10 bits.",
